  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline STEVIE MINT/GRAY is a technical hybrid designed by Toroline Chief String Officer Steve Johnson. It combines O-TORO TOUR 1.23 Mint in the mains for firm hexagonal control, stability and spin with Truffle X 1.30 Gray in the crosses for ultra-soft comfort, elasticity, feel and ball pocketing. The result is a precise and stable performance hybrid that significantly softens the response compared with a full polyester setup. Toroline recommends approximately 50-52 lbs for the O-TORO TOUR mains and 50-55 lbs with 5-10% prestretch for Truffle X.",

    "zh": "Toroline STEVIE MINT/GRAY 是由 Toroline Chief String Officer Steve Johnson 设计的技术型 Hybrid。主线采用 O-TORO TOUR 1.23 Mint，以偏硬六边形结构提供控制、稳定和旋转；横线采用 Truffle X 1.30 Gray，以超柔软现代 Polymer 提供舒适、弹性、Pocketing 和触球感。整体目标是在保留高级球员需要的精准和稳定的同时，大幅降低全聚酯线床的硬感。Toroline 建议 O-TORO TOUR 主线约 50-52 lbs，Truffle X 横线约 50-55 lbs，并对 Truffle X 使用 5-10% 预拉。"
  },

